{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12649","headline":"系乐府十二首 颂东夷 · 元结","name":"系乐府十二首 颂东夷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝闻古天子，朝会张新乐。\n金石无全声，宫商乱清浊。\n东惊且悲叹，节变何烦数。\n始知中国人，耽此亡纯朴。\n尔爲外方客，何爲独能觉。\n其音若或在，蹈海吾将学。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}